title: Marker Integration
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The inline and block dropdowns are populated from marker tiddlers tagged `$:/tags/CustomMarkup/Marker`. The filter intersects that tag with the vocabularies active for the tiddler being edited, so a new vocabulary's markers appear in the dropdown without any code change.

The `add-glyph` and `remove-glyph` buttons are enabled only for markers with `max-level > 1` (multi-level glyphs like `»` and `›`). `toggle-glyph` is enabled for any marker that is not `kind: inline-pair`. See [[Marker Kinds]] for the kind reference.

!! Markers per vocabulary

Each active vocabulary contributes its marker set to the dropdowns. The full ship list (click a vocab name for its summary view, click a marker name for its definition):

